---
// src/pages/solutions/infrastructure.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Infrastructure Solutions (Bare Metal, IaaS, GPU, Colocation) | InfraHub"
  description="Source high-performance dedicated servers, custom IaaS stacks, GPU AI training nodes, enterprise hardware, and colocation across global Tier-III facilities."
  canonicalPath="/solutions/infrastructure"
>
  <div class="section section-hero network-overlay">
    <div class="container hub-container">
      <div class="hub-header">
        <span class="hub-kicker">SOLUTION ARCHITECTURE // DISCIPLINE</span>
        <h1>Infrastructure & Compute</h1>
        <p class="hub-lead">
          Single-tenant dedicated servers, custom IaaS configurations, GPU AI acceleration, and wholesale datacenter colocation sourced around your strict workload constraints.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Service Discovery Cards -->
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Compute</span>
          <h2>Dedicated Bare Metal</h2>
          <p>Single-tenant enterprise servers with unmetered high-bandwidth network ports in Europe, North America, and Asia.</p>
          <a href="/offers" class="disc-link">View Bare Metal Offers →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Tailored Stacks</span>
          <h2>Custom IaaS</h2>
          <p>Bespoke combinations of compute + dedicated private networking + cross-connects (e.g. VoIP stacks, high-volume transactional platforms).</p>
          <a href="/lets-talk?service=custom-iaas" class="disc-link">Inquire Custom IaaS →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Accelerated Computing</span>
          <h2>GPU & AI Infrastructure</h2>
          <p>High-density NVIDIA H100, L40S, and A100 clusters with high-bandwidth InfiniBand and RoCE fabric interconnects.</p>
          <a href="/lets-talk?service=gpu-ai" class="disc-link">Inquire GPU Sourcing →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Datacenter Facilities</span>
          <h2>Colocation Space & Power</h2>
          <p>Secure 10kW to 40kW+ per rack across carrier-neutral facilities with direct MMR access and smart remote hands.</p>
          <a href="/colocation" class="disc-link">Explore Colocation →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Hardware Direct</span>
          <h2>Enterprise Hardware</h2>
          <p>Procure certified refurbished Dell and Supermicro servers with 3-year advanced replacement warranties.</p>
          <a href="/offers/dell-poweredge-r650-refurbished" class="disc-link">Inspect Server Stock →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Buyer Decision Framework -->
      <div class="hub-framework">
        <h2>Infrastructure Decision Framework</h2>
        <div class="framework-grid">
          <div class="framework-col">
            <h3>Workload Profile</h3>
            <p>Steady-state 24/7 database workloads are 50% cheaper on dedicated bare metal than on hyperscaler virtual machines.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="framework-col">
            <h3>CapEx vs OpEx</h3>
            <p>Direct hardware sourcing amortizes over 3-5 years for maximum margin; bare metal hosting provides zero-CapEx monthly flexibility.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="framework-col">
            <h3>Geographic Proximity</h3>
            <p>Placing compute directly inside metropolitan exchange MMRs (Frankfurt, Singapore) reduces eyeball RTT by up to 40ms.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-cta">
        <h2>Discuss Your Infrastructure Architecture</h2>
        <a href="/lets-talk?service=infrastructure" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Consult an Infrastructure Architect</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hub-container { max-width: 1040px; }
  .hub-header { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 54px; }
  .hub-kicker { font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--accent-blue); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .hub-header h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); font-weight: 800; margin: 16px 0; }
  .hub-lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }

  .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 64px; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) { .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }

  .service-discovery-card { background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
  .disc-pill { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .service-discovery-card h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .service-discovery-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .disc-link { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }
  .disc-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .hub-framework { background-color: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 48px; margin-bottom: 64px; }
  .hub-framework h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .framework-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .framework-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  .framework-col { background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 24px; }
  .framework-col h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .framework-col p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; }

  .hub-cta { background-color: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 44px 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; text-align: left; gap: 16px; margin-top: 48px; }
</style>
